our shout out tonight to a brave and  determined journalism teacher at a  California high school who gave her  students and her bosses a real-life  lesson in how the First Amendment should  work the faculty adviser for the school  newspaper at Bear Creek High School in  Stockton California is Kathy duffle I  love my job I love my students I will  always protect their right to free  speech and she had to put her job on the  line this year when her students came up  with the story at the school  administration well certainly did not  want public we were sitting around  pitching story ideas as we normally do  and one of the students pitched this  story and said you know I've been  hearing a lot about a girl named Caitlyn  on our campus and she is a sex worker  and there's been some rumors about her  and maybe she would welcome the chance  to to set the record straight  eighteen-year-old Caitlyn Fink agreed to  be interviewed by the student papers  menon GN etre bailey Kirkeby when I  first began writing this story it was  supposed to be just another profile of a  student like we do every issue but  Caitlyn's story included how the senior  had been working as a model for a porn  agency selling nude videos of herself  and aspiring to become a stripper it  wasn't even on my radar for me it was  just another student profile that we  were doing but then she received this  threatening letter from the school  superintendent after word quickly spread  about what the student paper was up to  that said that if we were to publish the  story and not submit it for prior review  to her then I would be subject to  disciplinary action up to and including  dismissal what did you make of that um I  was shocked I think I cried a little bit  first I I didn't understand the  overreach but California is one of the  14 states in the country that limit  unreasonable interference by  administrators with student newspapers  and she sought help from the student  press Law Center by then things were  getting pretty ugly there were some  intimidating factors  work and I was feeling pretty  uncomfortable at that point what kinds  of things were the intimidating factors  did you think one of them was to send a  police officer who was waiting at my  door for me one morning questioning me  about sex trafficking and distributing  pornography to minors but Kathy duffle  did not back down a group of determined  high schoolers in Stockton have  published a feature article on a fellow  student who works in the porn industry  the story in the school paper the Bruin  voice described how Caitlyn Fink  considered her adult entertainment  career as a job just like any other job  as I'm sure everyone now sees the  content is not obscene in any way it's  merely just showing the story of a young  student at our school who is on her own  living her independent life and having  to navigate the world of the pornography  industry and I feel though that's an  important story to tell and so far the  school has backed off its threat to fire  Kathy Duffy I am still employed yes I  think it's always a question she  receives support after national news  coverage of the showdown but most  important to her is the reaction of her  students she's been such an inspiration  and  everyone at school not just our class  and  glad that she's still here  and what is there inside of you that  gave you this kind of gumption I think  because this is not my first rodeo with  the district I have had some pretty  knock-down drag-out fights over the  years they've been hurtful and so I I  still have something to prove I think to  this district that even after 33 years  me putting my job on the line means that  I am serious about free speech and I  will always hold them accountable  so our shout out tonight to Cathy duffel  like many of us in this profession my  own career was launched at a high school  newspaper in Highland Park Illinois the  shoreline to this day I remember and  unthankful from all I 